\tab /Q If the \highlight1\f2 /Q\highlight0\f1  command-line option switch is set, the conversion\par
\tab    process will check for additional space in the file when a\par
\tab    \cf2\highlight3 <FF>\cf0\highlight0  character is encountered in the paper-tape input stream.\par
\tab    It may be desirable to include entire edit pages within the\par
\tab    same file.  However, this can lead to the need for additional\par
\tab    output files.\par
\par
\tab /S (\i Silent-running mode\i0 ) If the \highlight1\f2 /S\highlight0\f1  command-line option switch is\par
